  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Parashat Haman Reading for Tuesday Beshalach:2": {
   "kind": "instruction",
   "en": "Segulah from the Holy Rabbi Menachem Mendel of Rimanov zt\"l to recite on the third day of Parashat Beshalach: Parashat Haman, with two readings of the Hebrew and one of the Aramaic translation:"
