  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Awesome Prayer of Rabbeinu Tam:1": {
   "kind": "heading",
   "en": "Awesome and Holy Prayer of Rabbeinu Tam"
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Awesome Prayer of Rabbeinu Tam:2": {
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "<b><b><small>בספר <b>יוסף אומץ</b> <small>(אות תפד)</small>",
     "kind": "note",
     "en": "In the book Yosef Ometz (letter Tefad):"
    },
    {
     "text": ": תפילה זו קבלה מרבינו תם: <b>\"האומרה בכל יום,",
     "kind": "note",
     "en": "This prayer was received from Rabbeinu Tam: \"He who recites it every day, I guarantee that no evil will befall him that day and he will succeed in all his ways.\""
    },
    {
     "text": " אני ערב בדבר שלא יארע לו שום פגע רע כל אותו יום ויצליח בכל דרכו\"</b>:</small></b></b>",
     "kind": "note",
     "en": "."
    }
   ]
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Awesome Prayer of Rabbeinu Tam:3": {
   "kind": "prayer"
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Awesome Prayer of Rabbeinu Tam:4": {
   "kind": "prayer"
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Awesome Prayer of Rabbeinu Tam:5": {
   "kind": "prayer"
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Awesome Prayer of Rabbeinu Tam:6": {
   "kind": "prayer"
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Awesome Prayer of Rabbeinu Tam:7": {
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "<b><b><small>ג' פעמים:</small>",
     "kind": "instruction",
     "en": "Three times:"
    },
    {
     "text": " <b>יְהֹוָה צְבָאוֹת עִמָּנוּ,",
     "kind": "prayer",
     "repeat": 3
    },
    {
     "text": " מִשְׂגָב לָנוּ אֱלֹהֵי יַעֲקֹב סֶלָה:</b> </b></b>",
     "kind": "prayer"
    }
   ]
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Awesome Prayer of Rabbeinu Tam:8": {
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "<b><b><small>ג' פעמים:</small>",
     "kind": "instruction",
     "en": "Three times:"
    },
    {
     "text": " <b>יְהֹוָה צְבָאוֹת,",
     "kind": "prayer",
     "repeat": 3
    },
    {
     "text": " אַשְׁרֵי אָדָם בּוֹטֵחַ בָּךְ: </b></b></b>",
     "kind": "prayer"
    }
   ]
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Awesome Prayer of Rabbeinu Tam:9": {
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "<b><b><small>ג' פעמים:</small>",
     "kind": "instruction",
     "en": "Three times:"
    },
    {
     "text": " <b>יְהֹוָה הוֹשִׁיעָה | הַמֶּלֶךְ יַעֲנֵנוּ בְּיוֹם קָרְאֵנוּ: </b></b></b>",
     "kind": "prayer",
     "repeat": 3
    }
   ]
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Awesome Prayer of Rabbeinu Tam:10": {
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "<b><b><small>ג' פעמים:</small>",
     "kind": "instruction",
     "en": "Three times:"
    },
    {
     "text": " <b>הַמַּלְאָךְ הַגֹּאֵל אֹתִי מִכָּל רַע יְבָרֵך אֶת הַנְּעָרִים וְיִקָרֵא בָּהֶם שְׁמִי וְשֵׁם אֲבֹתַי אַבְרָהָם וְיִצְחָק וְיִדְגוּ לָרֹב בְּקֶרֶב הָאָרֶץ: </b></b></b>",
     "kind": "prayer",
     "repeat": 3
    }
   ]
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Awesome Prayer of Rabbeinu Tam:11": {
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "<b><b><small>ז' פעמים:</small>",
     "kind": "instruction",
     "en": "Seven times:"
    },
    {
     "text": " <b>לִישׁוּעָתְךָ קִוִּיתִי יְהֹוָה. לְפֻרְקָנָךְ סַבָּרִית יְהֹוָה: </b></b></b>",
     "kind": "prayer",
     "repeat": 7
    }
   ]
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Awesome Prayer of Rabbeinu Tam:12": {
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "<b><b><small>ז' פעמים:</small>",
     "kind": "instruction",
     "en": "Seven times:"
    },
    {
     "text": " <b>גָּד גְּדוּד יְגוּדֶנּוּ וְהוּא יָגֻד עָקֵב: </b></b></b>",
     "kind": "prayer",
     "repeat": 7
    }
   ]
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Awesome Prayer of Rabbeinu Tam:13": {
   "kind": "prayer"
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Formula Against Evil Eye:1": {
   "kind": "heading",
   "en": "Various Prayers and Segulot"
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Formula Against Evil Eye:2": {
   "kind": "heading",
   "en": "Incantation against the Evil Eye"
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Formula Against Evil Eye:3": {
   "kind": "instruction",
   "en": "A tested incantation against the evil eye from the book Avodat HaKodesh by the Chida zt\"l:"
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Formula Against Evil Eye:4": {
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "<b>מַשְׁבִּיעַ</b> אֲנִי עֲלֵיכֶם כָּל מִין עֵינָא בִּישָׁא. עֵינָא אוּכְמָא,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא צְרוֹבָא,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא תְכֶלְתָּא,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא יְרוֹקָא,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא אַרוּכָּא,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא קְצָרָה,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא רְחָבָה,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא צָרָה,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא יְשָׁרָה,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא עֲקוּמָה עֵינָא עֲגוּלָה,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא שׁוֹקַעֲת,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא בּוֹלֶטֶת,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא רוֹאָה,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא מַבֶּטֶת,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא בּוֹקַעֲת,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא שׁוֹאֶבֶת,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא דִדְכוּרָא,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא דְנוּקְבָא,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא דְאִישׁ וְאִשְׁתּוֹ,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עַיִן דְאִשָׁה וּבִתָּהּ,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עַיִן דְאִשָׁה וּקְרוֹבָתָהּ,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עַיִן דְבָּחוּר,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עַיִן דְזָקֵן,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עַיִן דִזְקֵנָה,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עַיִן דִבְּתוּלָה,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עַיִן דִבְּעוּלָה,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עַיִן דְאַלְמָנָה עַיִן דִנְשׂוּאָה,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עַיִן דִגְרוּשָׁה,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " כָּל מִין,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא בִּישָׁא שֶׁיֵּשׁ בָּעוֹלָם שֶׁרָאֲתָה וְהִבִּיטָה וְדִבְּרָה בְּעַיִן הָרָע עַל ",
     "kind": "prayer",
     "en": "(Name of the person)"
    },
    {
     "text": "<small> <small>(פ\"ב פלונית)</small>",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " </small> גְזַרְנָא וְאַשְׁבַּעְנָא לְכוֹן בְּהַהוּא עֵינָא עִילָאָה,",
     "kind": "prayer",
     "en": "(Yahdunehi)"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא קַדִישָׁא,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא חָדָא,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא חִוְרָא,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא דְאִיהִי חִוָר גוֹ חִוָר,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא דְכָּלִיל כָּל חִוָר,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא דְכֹּלָא יְמִינָא עֵינָא פְּקִיחָא,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא דְאַשְׁגָחוּתָא תְּדִירָא,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא דְכֹּלָא רַחֲמֵי,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא דְאִיהִי רַחֲמֵי גוֹ רַחֲמֵי עֵינָא דְכָּלִיל כָּל רַחֲמֵי,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא דְלֵית עֲלָהּ גַבְנוּנֵי,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא דְלָא אַדְמִיךְ וְלֹא נָאִים,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא דְכָל עֵיְינִין בִּישִׁין אִתְכַּפְיָין וְאִתְטַמְרָן גוֹ כֵיפִין מִן קֳדָמוֹהִי,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עֵינָא דְנָטִיר לְיִשְׂרָאֵל כְּדִכְתִיב הִנֵּה לֹא יָנוּם וְלֹא יִישָׁן שׁוֹמֵר יִשְׂרָאֵל וּכְתִיב הִנֵּה,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " עַיִן יְהֹוָה ",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": "<small>(יאהדונהי)</small>",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " אֶל יְרֵאָיו לַמְיַחֲלִים לְחַסְדוֹ:",
     "kind": "prayer"
    }
   ]
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Formula Against Evil Eye:5": {
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "<b>בְּהַהִיא</b> עֵינָא עִילָאָה,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " גְזָרִית וְאַשְׁבָּעִית עֲלֵיכוֹן כָּל מִין עֵינָא בִּישָׁא שֶׁתָּסוּרוּ וְתַעֲרְקוּ וְתִבְרְחוּ וְתַרְחִיקוּ מֵעַל ",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": "<small> <small>(פ\"ב פלונית)</small>",
     "kind": "prayer",
     "en": "(Name of the person)"
    },
    {
     "text": " </small> וּמֵעַל כָּל בְּנֵי בֵּיתוֹ ",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": "<small> <small>(לנקיבה בֵּיתָהּ)</small>",
     "kind": "prayer",
     "en": "(For a female: her house)"
    },
    {
     "text": " </small>,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " וְלֹא יִהְיֶה לָכֶם כֹּחַ לִשְׁלוֹט ",
     "kind": "prayer",
     "en": "(Name of the person)"
    },
    {
     "text": "<small> <small>(בְּפ\"ב פלונית)</small>",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " </small> וּבְכָל בְּנֵי בֵּיתוֹ ",
     "kind": "prayer",
     "en": "(For a female: her house)"
    },
    {
     "text": "<small> <small>(לנקיבה בֵּיתָהּ)</small>",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " </small>,",
     "kind": "prayer",
     "en": "(For a female: not in any of her limbs, and not in any of her sinews)"
    },
    {
     "text": " לֹא בַּיוֹם וְלֹא בַּלַיְלָה לֹא בְּהָקִיץ וְלֹא בַּחֲלוֹם,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " לֹא בְּשׁוּם אֵבֶר מֵרְמַ\"ח אֵבָרָיו,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " וְלֹא בְּשׁוּם גִיד מִשְׁסָ\"ה גִידָיו, ",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": "<small> <small>(לנקיבה לֹא בְּשׁוּם אֵבֶר מֵאֵבָרֶיהָ וְלֹא בְּשׁוּם גִיד מִגִּידֶיהָ)</small>",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " </small> מֵהַיּוֹם וּלְעוֹלָם אָמֵן נֶצַח סֶלָה וָעֶד:",
     "kind": "prayer"
    }
   ]
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Formula Against Evil Eye:6": {
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "<b><b><small><b><small>(ג\"פ)</small>",
     "kind": "prayer",
     "en": "(3 times)"
    },
    {
     "text": "</b></small> <b>אַתָּה</b> סֵתֶר לִי מִצַּר תִּצְרֵנִי רָנֵי פַלֵּט תְּסוֹבְבֵנִי סֶלָה:</b></b>",
     "kind": "prayer"
    }
   ]
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Formula Against Evil Eye:7": {
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "<b><b><small><b><small>(ג\"פ)</small>",
     "kind": "prayer",
     "en": "(3 times)"
    },
    {
     "text": "</b></small> <b>סֶלָה</b> תְּסוֹבְבֵנִי פַלֵּט רָנֵי תִּצְּרֵנִי מִצַּר לִי סֵתֶר אַתָּה:</b></b>",
     "kind": "prayer"
    }
   ]
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Formula Against Evil Eye:8": {
   "kind": "instruction",
   "en": "All of this is said 3 times:"
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Prayer of the Shelah:1": {
   "kind": "heading",
   "en": "Prayer of the Holy Shelah"
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Prayer of the Shelah:2": {
   "kind": "instruction",
   "en": "A prayer from the book of the Holy Shelah for any time, especially on the eve of Rosh Chodesh Sivan, the month crowned with the crown of Torah, to pray for oneself and one's descendants to walk in the ways of the upright, to educate children, and to find suitable matches for building houses of Torah and holiness. (Book of Shnei Luchot HaBrit, Tractate Tamid, Chapter Ner Mitzvah)"
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Prayer of the Shelah:3": {
   "kind": "instruction",
   "en": "It is incumbent upon us to pray and request from God for all our needs, for everything comes from Him. Therefore, whenever a person needs something at any time, they should accustom themselves to a short prayer to cast upon the Lord. At the time of the action, one should say for all needs: 'For the sake of the holy unification of the Holy One, blessed be He, and His Shekhinah, Master of the worlds, succeed my ways, for everything is from You, etc.' One must especially urge prayer to have worthy offspring for all eternity, and through their needs and marriages, may the matter come from God. My heart says that the time of favor for this prayer is on the eve of Rosh Chodesh Sivan, the month in which the Torah was given, and then we are called children of God. It is fitting to sit in fasting on that day, he and his wife, and to arouse themselves to repentance and correct all matters of the house regarding forbidden and permitted, impurity and purity, and all matters, and to give charity to worthy poor. If possible for the husband to fast, then the interruption is very good and pleasant, and in any case, it should be a complete fast according to all the laws of a public fast."
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Prayer of the Shelah:4": {
   "kind": "instruction",
   "en": "It is customary to say before this ten chapters of Psalms that the Shelah ordained to be said every day: 89, 90, 147, 25, 91, 120, 109, 138, 107, 126."
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Prayer of the Shelah:5": {
   "kind": "instruction",
   "en": "And some are accustomed to read afterwards the letters Kof-Resh-Ayin, Samech-Tet-Nun from Chapter 119. And after that, they say the prayer for the children:"
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Prayer of the Shelah:6": {
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "<b>\"אַתָּה</b> הוּא יְהֹוָה אֱלֹהֵינוּ עַד שֶׁלּא בָרָאתָ הָעוֹלָם,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " וְאַתָּה הוּא אֱלֹהֵינוּ מִשֶּׁבָּרָאתָ הָעוֹלָם,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " וּמֵעוֹלָם וְעַד עוֹלָם אַתָּה אֵל,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " וּבָרָאתָ עוֹלָמְךָ בְּגִין לְהִשְׁתְּמוֹדָעָא ",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": "<small>(כדי להודיע)</small>",
     "kind": "instruction",
     "en": "(in order to make known)"
    },
    {
     "text": " אֱלָהוּתָךְ בְּאֶמְצָעוּת תּוֹרָתְךָ הַקְּדוֹשָׁה כְּמוֹ שֶׁאָמְרוּ רַבּוֹתֵינוּ זִכְרוֹנָם לִבְרָכָה,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " \"בְּרֵאשִׁית\",",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " בִּשְׁבִיל תּוֹרָה וּבִשְׁבִיל יִשְׂרָאֵל,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " כִּי הֵם עַמְּךָ וְנַחֲלָתְךָ אֲשֶׁר בָּחַרְתָּ בָּהֶם מִכָּל הָאֻמּוֹת,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " וְנָתַתָּ לָהֶם תּוֹרָתְךָ הַקְּדוֹשָׁה,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " וְקֵרַבְתָּם לְשִׁמְךָ הַגָּדוֹל: ",
     "kind": "prayer"
    }
   ]
  },
  "he:Various Prayers & Segulot/Prayer of the Shelah:7": {
   "parts": [
    {
     "text": "<b>וְעַל</b> קִיּוּם הָעוֹלָם וְעַל קִיּוּם הַתּוֹרָה בָּא לָנוּ מִמְּךָ יְהֹוָה אֱלֹהֵינוּ שְׁנֵי צִוּוּיִים,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " כָּתַבְתָּ בְּתוֹרָתֶךָָ \"פְּרוּ וּרְבוּ\",",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " וְכָתַבְתָּ בְּתוֹרָתֶךָָ \"וְלִמַּדְתֶּם אֹתָם אֶת בְּנֵיכֶם\",",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " וְהַכַּוָּנָה בִשְׁתֵּיהֶן אֶחָת,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " כִּי לֹא לְתֹהוּ בָרָאתָ כִּי אִם לָשֶׁבֶת,",
     "kind": "prayer"
    },
    {
     "text": " וְלִכְבוֹדְךָ בָּרָאתָ יָצַרְתָּ אַף עָשִׂיתָ,",
